{"slug": "haute-living-celebrates-marc-anthony-with-bulova-florida-yachts-international-and-mg-developer-at-mr-c-coconut-grove", "title": "Haute Living Celebrates Marc Anthony with Bulova, Florida Yachts International, And MG Developer At Mr. C Coconut Grove", "description": "Florida Yachts International, in collaboration with Haute Living and Bulova, celebrated the legendary Marc Anthony at the luxurious Mr. C...", "date": "2023-10-25", "category": "Blog", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-18.png", "html": "<p>Florida Yachts International, in collaboration with <a href=\"https://hauteliving.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Haute Living</a> and <a href=\"https://www.bulova.com/us/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bulova</a>, celebrated the legendary Marc Anthony at the luxurious Mr. C in Coconut Grove, honoring his iconic contributions to tropical salsa music. It was a night infused with the melodies of a four-time Grammy Award-winner and eight-time Latin Grammy Award-winning artist. The evening commenced with a grand toast to the guest of honor, Marc Anthony, featuring Champagne Telmont. The private cocktail and dinner was made possible by the generous contributions of partners, including <a href=\"http://fyiyachts.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Florida Yachts International</a>, MG Developer, and The Village of Coral Gables.</p><p>This extravagant affair also served as the unofficial 2023 Billboard Latin Music Awards afterparty, truly capping off the night in style. DJ Arkitekt provided the perfect musical backdrop, ensuring the dance floor remained vibrant throughout the night, and Siobhan Cronin contributed to the ambiance with a captivating violin performance featuring some of Marc’s favorite melodies. In every aspect, this event was a harmonious blend of opulence and celebration, leaving an indelible mark in the hearts of those in attendance.</p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-15.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-15-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-16.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-16-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-17.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-17-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-18.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebrates-Marc-Anthony-with-Bulova-Florida-Yachts-International-And-MG-Developer-At-Mr.-C-Coconut-Grove-18-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2023/10/Haute-Living-Celebra